Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:37.50,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}君の手が眩しさを掴んだら大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:48.10,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}影のように消えたとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:46.62,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}在海风中轻轻摇曳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:54.04,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}轻轻伸手遮挡…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:11:00.72,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}遥远的夜空下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:06.81,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}眯着眼遥望
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:15.94,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}不知不觉间已在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:25.03,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}迎着白色浪花游动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:37.50,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}若你的手能抓住那份光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:48.10,INCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}即使如影子般消逝也无妨
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,——SCREEN——
